<HelloFraandsPage title="Join & earn" summary="Ghar se baat karein, apne waqt par kamaayein.">
<h2>Good at listening? Start here.</h2><p>You do not need a professional title to have a kind conversation. {BRAND.name} welcomes ordinary adults, including women at home who want flexible hours. Choose when to go online and the topics you enjoy. Hosting is for conversation, not regulated advice.</p>
<h2>What could you earn?</h2><p>These examples assume 2 hours of fully paid calls each day for 25 days: 3,000 paid minutes. Being online does not guarantee calls. Amounts below are after platform commission and before TDS or your own taxes.</p>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><caption>Illustrative earnings for 3,000 paid minutes</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Caller rate</th><th scope="col">Host share per minute</th><th scope="col">Monthly host share</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>₹5/min</td><td>₹1.80</td><td>₹5,400</td></tr><tr><td>₹25/min</td><td>₹13.80</td><td>₹41,400</td></tr><tr><td>₹30/min</td><td>₹16.80</td><td>₹50,400</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>The platform keeps ₹2 plus 40% of the amount above ₹2. See <a href="/hosts/rates">rates, payouts &amp; taxes</a>.</p>
<p>Your privacy is protected. Your phone number stays hidden behind our masked line. Hosts appear only as an AI avatar they chose — never their real photo.</p>
<h2>Steps to hosting</h2><ol><li>Sign up with your own phone number using WhatsApp OTP.</li><li>Verify your Aadhaar with an OTP (or DigiLocker if OTP doesn't work).</li><li>Record a 10-second selfie video.</li><li>Pass a UPI or bank account check.</li><li>Set up your profile: choose your moods, languages and price.</li><li>Go online when available. The planned payout route is weekly UPI, subject to final terms.</li></ol>
<p>Read the <a href="/hosts/requirements">host requirements</a>, <a href="/hosts/rules">host rules</a> and <a href="/hosts/agreement">host agreement</a> before you apply.</p>
<p><a class="hf-button" href="/sign-up">Sign up to become a host →</a></p><p>The current site includes sample profiles. Calls and payments are not available in the preview.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
